# Generated run artifacts: screenshots, browser audits, release snapshots, vendored
# Python wheels, logs and Aspen working copies. Regenerate locally; do not commit.
# Everything under outputs/ is ignored except the folders that build scripts and
# tests read (see below). A few small evidence files under
# outputs/workspace-bilingual-20261117/ (preregistered plans, raw native run
# records, scripts/notes) stay tracked because analysis_web/data/generic-htl-extension
# pins them by SHA-256; tracked files are unaffected by these rules.
/outputs/*
!/outputs/htl_pipeline/
!/outputs/universal_pipeline/
!/outputs/htl_energy_lca_workflow/

# Local virtualenvs, build output and Vercel CLI state
.venv*/
venv/
extrudecad-web/dist/
.vercel/
